  "description": "Buffered GCB-95 signal-path topology from the ElectroSmash schematic. The output shares the AC-coupled top of the treadle pot, its wiper feeds the second transistor through a separate capacitor, and the 470 kΩ DC bias path bypasses the pot. The existing 2N3904 models approximate the reference MPSA13 and MPSA18 transistors. https://electrosmash.mas-effects.com/crybaby-gcb-95",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
